{"id":"stufo","lemma":"stufo","pos":"adj","rank":2709,"glosses":["sick, fed up, tired","stuffed"],"ipa":"/ˈstu.fo/","forms":{"feminine":"stufa","masculinePlural":"stufi","femininePlural":"stufe"},"formAudio":{"stufa":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/68/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-DivoLetto-stufa.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Sono così stufo di lavorare.","en":"I am so sick of working.","words":[{"g":"am / are","l":"essere"},{"g":"so"},null,{"g":"of"},{"g":"to work"}]},{"text":"È stufo dei miei problemi.","en":"He is fed up with my problems.","words":[{"g":"is","l":"essere"},null,{"g":"some"},{"g":"\"my parents\""},{"g":"problem","l":"problema"}]},{"text":"Non siete ancora stufi di me?","en":"Aren't you sick of me yet?","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"to be","l":"essere"},{"g":"still / again"},null,{"g":"of"},{"g":"me"}]},{"text":"Sono stufo della scuola.","en":"I'm sick of school.","words":[{"g":"am / are","l":"essere"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"school"}]},{"text":"Sono stufo del pesce.","en":"I'm sick of fish.","words":[{"g":"am / are","l":"essere"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"fish"}]}]}